Contributed by: nicksmith  Date: Wed Jan  2 23:43:22 1991
This is the Elite BBS v.31 (freely distributable) for the Amiga.
It has Zmodem, works with the HST or Dual Standard, message base, chat,
and some other good stuff.
You may pass this around to anyone who wants to set up a Bulletin
Board System on their Amiga computer.  It multi-tasks very nicely
so you can run it while doing other things.  It's not necessary
to have Arexx, Arp or anything else present in your system but having
those things will not hamper the operation of the BBS.

